 پل‌های ارتباطی</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">توضیحات محصولات</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-2\">کپی تبلیغاتی، ویژگی‌ها، فواید محصولات</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">کپی قانع‌کننده، بیان مزایا،_call-to-action</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group animate-fade-in border-0 shadow-lg\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-semibold\">مطالب ارگانیک</h3></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-2\">مطالب انگیزشی، اخبار شرکت، داستان‌های موفق</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">روایت جذاب، هدف‌گذاری فروش، برندینگ</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-indigo-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">ویژگی‌های <span class=\"gradient-text\">محتوای ما</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">چرا کیفیت محتوای عصر سئو بالاتر از سایر رقباست؟</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-green-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scroll-text h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><path d=\"M15 12h-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8h-5\"></path><path d=\"M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">مقالات تخصصی و سئو محور</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">نگارش مقالات هدفمند و کاملاً بهینه برای موتورهای جستجو در حوزه شما.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" cl